<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10547"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Weeza<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Weeza<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 04, 2005 - 8:21 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://www.kake.com/news/headlines/1058986.html" target=_top>http://www.kake.com/news/headlines/1058986.html</a> <BR>there&#39;s an article about his case work <BR><a href="http://www.thisislocallondon.co.uk/misc/print.php?artid=477991" target=_top>http://www.thisislocallondon.co.uk/misc/print.php? artid=477991</a> <BR>london news <BR><a href="http://www.kansas.com/mld/eagle/9786873.htm" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/mld/eagle/9786873.htm</a> <BR>kansas news link w/ dennis<!--/Text--></td></tr>
