<!--Post: 11257--><!--Time: 1110532712-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11257"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Weeza<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Weeza<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 11, 2005 - 1:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->posted on kansas.com, another prediction of Den&#39;s: <BR> <BR>From: 	LaoisesBack  	Mar-10 9:33 pm  <BR> <BR> <BR>Ok, to all you nay-sayers out there I say HA! <BR> <BR>Dennis McKenzie hit the nail on the head yet again!!! <BR> <BR>We know he described the &#34;secret symbol&#34; to such accuracy while he was here that LE decided to pay attention to his file he prepared. <BR> <BR>We know that Dennis said that BTK&#39;s demise would come the end of February and that it would be the result of &#34;one communication too many&#34; <BR> <BR>Now we hear on the news that the Oh Anna poem actually had the name &#34;Louis&#34; on it but it was crossed out and the name Anna written in above it. HA I say!!! Dennis made a voice recording a couple months ago in which he asked if anyone could tell him who &#34;Loiuse&#34; or &#34;Louisa&#34; was because he was getting that name concerning the Anna case and he didnt know who it was!!! <BR> <BR>Flame me all you want but... <BR>HA! <BR>HA! <BR>HA! <BR> <BR>Dennis ROCKS! <BR> <a href="http://forums.prospero.com/n/mb/message.asp?webtag=kr-kansas_news&amp;msg=7201.1&amp;ctx=262144" target=_top>http://forums.prospero.com/n/mb/message.asp?webtag =kr-kansas_news&amp;msg=7201.1&amp;ctx=262144</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
